   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCO-Voices for health rights 2010-15 - VHR RFSU support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till koalition Voices for Health Rights i gemensamt program      kring m&#xf6;drah&#xe4;lsa. Fokus p&#xe5; utbildning i advocacy, SRHR och MDG 5 av   byinv&#xe5;nare och h&#xe4;lsopersonal liksom kapacitetsutveckling av VHR NGOs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to coalition of NGOs in Voices for Health Rights with a joint programme on Maternal Health. FOcus on advocacy and community         mobilization for the right to health, accountability of health        suthorities, sensitization of health workers and strengthening M&amp;E    systems of VHR, capacity development of the 14 NGOs in SRHR, MDG 5,   advocacy and financial management.</narrative>
  </description>
